useTeslaEnergySites          GET  /tesla/energy-sites                          -> EnergyProductsSource.StreamAsync         (op get_api_v1_tesla_energy_sites)
useRefreshTeslaEnergySites   POST /tesla/energy-sites/refresh                  -> EnergyProductsSource.RefreshAsync        (op post_api_v1_tesla_energy_sites_refresh)
useTeslaEnergySiteInfo       GET  /tesla/energy-sites/{siteId}/site-info       -> EnergySiteInfoSource.StreamAsync         (op get_api_v1_tesla_energy_sites_siteID_site_info)
useRefreshTeslaEnergySiteInfo POST /tesla/energy-sites/{siteId}/site-info/refresh -> EnergySiteInfoSource.RefreshAsync     (op post_api_v1_tesla_energy_sites_siteID_site_info_refresh)
All four route through the shared CacheThenNetworkEngine; SI Wh/W are read directly and restated to
compact display units only at the projection boundary (EnergyProductsProjection.FormatEnergy/FormatPower).

